          "settings": {
            "text": "<p><strong>Introducing: The Selfridges SS26 Capsule<br/><br/></strong>As we embark on our journey within the landmark which is Selfridges. We introduce a focussed selection of pieces built on the pillars of what we do best. The capsule features the V2 Zip Hoodie in Powder Blue, a all new Bermuda Denim in Stone Wash, Duck Canvas Shorts in Sage and our classic Football Polo in Thyme. Fresh essentials for the season with a twist. The capsule is available exclusively at Selfridges London, Birmingham and Online.<br/><br/>A landmark moment deserves a definitive collection. This capsule delivers elevated seasonal essentials with a twist.</p>"
